    "Reason : 1 - The proposal, by reason of its scale and design would fail to respect the scale and proportions of the original dwelling and would therefore be harmful to the property itself and the wider street scene, to the detriment of the character and appearance of the local area and street scene contrary to Local Plan policies CC1, CC2, SC7 and Part A5 (Residential Extension Guidelines) of the adopted Character, Sustainability and Design Codes Supplementary Planning Document",
